/P 103 0 R
/E (The Secure Document Storage System was developed as part of my Cloud Computing Internship at Edutantr using Amazon Web Services \(AWS\). The main purpose of the project was to create a secure cloud-based environment for storing documents using Amazon S3.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
207 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (I configured the S3 storage environment with appropriate access permissions and server-side encryption to protect the stored documents. I also worked with AWS IAM to control access to the resources and used AWS Lambda and CloudWatch as part of the serverless processing and monitoring setup.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
